  <releases>
    <release version="0.8.1" date="2026-01-14">
      <description>
        <p>QR verification and code quality release:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>QR verification code in visible signatures (hash, signer, timestamp)</li>
          <li>Refactored PKCS#11 library paths for better modularity</li>
          <li>Updated packaging scripts with all dependencies</li>
          <li>High quality stamp rendering (150 DPI)</li>
