        <p>QR verification code feature:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Optional QR code in visible signatures</li>
          <li>QR contains document hash, signer name, and timestamp</li>
          <li>New --qr-code CLI flag</li>
          <li>GUI checkbox in signature options</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.7.0" date="2026-01-14">
