          <li>Flatpak with GNOME Platform 49</li>
          <li>AppImage portable distribution</li>
          <li>Debian package (.deb)</li>
          <li>GitHub Actions release workflow</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.6.0" date="2026-01-14">
      <description>
        <p>Multi-token PKCS#11 support:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Auto-detection for 8+ token types</li>
          <li>Improved TSA timestamp integration</li>
          <li>Theme and language settings</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.1.0" date="2025-12-01">
      <description>
        <p>Initial release with core features.</p>
